CREATE TABLE "TrainingPlanWeek" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,"planId" TEXT NOT NULL,"dayOfWeek" TEXT NOT NULL,"focus" TEXT,"apparatusFocus" TEXT,"physicalFocus" TEXT,"notes" TEXT,"orderIndex" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,"createdAt" DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" DATETIME NOT NULL,CONSTRAINT "TrainingPlanWeek_planId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("planId") REFERENCES "TrainingPlan" ("id") ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE);
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "TrainingPlanWeek_planId_dayOfWeek_key" ON "TrainingPlanWeek"("planId","dayOfWeek");
CREATE INDEX "TrainingPlanWeek_planId_orderIndex_idx" ON "TrainingPlanWeek"("planId","orderIndex");
CREATE TABLE "TrainingPlanSkillTarget" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,"planId" TEXT NOT NULL,"skillId" TEXT NOT NULL,"gymnastId" TEXT,"priority" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'PRIMARY',"notes" TEXT,"createdAt" DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" DATETIME NOT NULL,CONSTRAINT "TrainingPlanSkillTarget_planId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("planId") REFERENCES "TrainingPlan" ("id") ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,CONSTRAINT "TrainingPlanSkillTarget_skillId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("skillId") REFERENCES "ViaformSkill" ("id") ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,CONSTRAINT "TrainingPlanSkillTarget_gymnastId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("gymnastId") REFERENCES "Gymnast" ("id") ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE);
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "TrainingPlanSkillTarget_planId_skillId_gymnastId_priority_key" ON "TrainingPlanSkillTarget"("planId","skillId","gymnastId","priority");
CREATE INDEX "TrainingPlanSkillTarget_planId_priority_idx" ON "TrainingPlanSkillTarget"("planId","priority");
CREATE INDEX "TrainingPlanSkillTarget_skillId_idx" ON "TrainingPlanSkillTarget"("skillId");
CREATE INDEX "TrainingPlanSkillTarget_gymnastId_idx" ON "TrainingPlanSkillTarget"("gymnastId");
